\newlabel{fig:bell-curves-synthetic}{{4.2}{43}{Bell curves showing feature distributions before (blue) and after (red) drift injection. Left: Abrupt drift with clear separation. Right: Gradual drift with overlapping distributions---the subtle shift that D3, SPLL, and UDetect all failed to detect}{figure.caption.9}{}}
