\newlabel{fig:timeseries-synthetic}{{4.3}{43}{Time-series comparison of all eight detectors. Left: Abrupt drift---most detectors respond near the true drift point (dashed line). Right: Gradual drift---only EADD, BNDM, CSDDM, IBDD, and OCDD detect the shift; D3, SPLL, and UDetect remain silent}{figure.caption.10}{}}
